    <string name="rules_main_game_title">Main game</string>
    <string name="rules_main_game_body">You must complete the objectives shown on screen.
In each level, the dice are rolled and then you choose which dice to use.
You can always solve the level by using only some of the dice.
Difficulty increases in stages: more dice and a progressive mix of 6-, 8-, and 10-sided dice.</string>

    <string name="rules_objectives_cards_title">Objectives</string>
    <string name="rules_objectives_cards_body">Each level has 1 or more conditions, plus a minimum number of selected dice condition.
There are sum objectives (exact, minimum, maximum, range, multiples, even/odd), combinations (pair, three of a kind, four of a kind, full house, straight, all different), and value collection/forbidden objectives.
The level is completed when all active conditions are met at the same time with the selected dice.</string>

    <string name="rules_cards_title">Cards</string>
    <string name="rules_cards_body">When you start a new game, you receive 3 random cards.
Cards carry over between levels and can repeat.
Each use consumes that card.</string>

